      "description": "Single-line tool input with a neutral active border and one thin neutral keyboard outline; text selection follows the neutral selection token.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Endpoint<input class=\"ds-input\" value=\"https://api.example.com\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;color:var(--wb-text-heading);font-weight:550}.ds-input{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;height:40px;padding:8px 12px;line-height:22px;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--signal-control-border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--wb-card-bg);color:var(--wb-text-heading);font-weight:400}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--signal-control-border)}.ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--signal-secondary);box-shadow:none}.ds-input::selection{background:var(--selection-bg);color:var(--wb-text-heading)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--wb-focus-ring);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected category",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-selected",
      "description": "Regular 12px sidebar and landing category labels share one navigation token. Selected navigation retains cobalt; collapsed sidebar popups are 300px, wrap labels and close on navigation.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Tool categories\"><button class=\"ds-category\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span>Formatters</span><span>Browse</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-category{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:var(--signal-nav-size,12px);line-height:1.65;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:9px;width:100%;min-height:37px;padding:10px 9px;border:0;border-radius:4px;text-align:start;background:var(--wb-accent-soft);color:var(--wb-accent);font-weight:400;cursor:pointer}.ds-category:hover,.ds-category:active{background:var(--wb-accent-soft)}.ds-category:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--wb-focus-ring);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Technical tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag",
      "description": "Noninteractive technical metadata from the discovery illustration.",
      "html": "<code class=\"ds-tag\">JSON</code>",
      "css": ".ds-tag{font-family:var(--font-geist-mono),monospace;font-size:11px;display:inline-block;padding:5px 9px;border:1px solid var(--wb-card-border);border-radius:4px;color:var(--wb-text-body);background:var(--wb-card-bg);overflow-wrap:anywhere}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Working panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Flat mixed-content panel with an inset heading and 18px content gutter. Only a sole direct code-editor child removes the body gutter.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h3>Response</h3><div>Run the tool to inspect its output.</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;border:1px solid var(--wb-card-border);border-radius:7px;color:var(--wb-text-heading);background:var(--wb-card-bg);box-shadow:none;overflow:hidden}.ds-panel h3{font:550 12px/1.65 var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;margin:0;min-height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 18px;background:var(--signal-inset);border-bottom:1px solid var(--wb-card-border)}.ds-panel>div{padding:18px;color:var(--wb-text-body)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalog tool row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "catalog-row",
      "description": "Direct canonical link into a real tool, with a processing boundary.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"/formatters/json-formatter\"><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>JSON Formatter</strong><span>Format and inspect JSON data.</span></span><small>On device</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-row{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:19px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--wb-card-border);background:transparent;color:var(--wb-text-heading);text-decoration:none}.ds-copy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:175px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-copy strong{font-size:12px;font-weight:550;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-copy>span{font-size:12px;color:var(--wb-text-body)}.ds-row small{font-size:9px;color:var(--wb-text-muted)}.ds-row:hover{background:var(--signal-inset)}.ds-row:active{color:var(--wb-accent)}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--wb-focus-ring);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-copy{display:block}.ds-copy>span{display:block;margin-top:5px}.ds-row{gap:12px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Carousel next control",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "carousel-control",
      "description": "Circular discovery control; navigation behavior remains in the component.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-next\" aria-label=\"Next tool\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-next{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--signal-control-border);border-radius:50%;background:var(--wb-card-bg);color:var(--wb-accent);cursor:pointer}.ds-next:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-next:active{background:var(--wb-accent);border-color:var(--wb-accent);color:var(--signal-action-ink)}.ds-next:disabled{color:var(--wb-text-muted);opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-next:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--wb-focus-ring);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:620px){.ds-next{width:30px;height:30px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Labeled toolbar",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "labeled-toolbar",
      "description": "Labels above controls; 40px controls and actions share a baseline, with a full-width primary action and equal secondary columns on mobile.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toolbar\"><label class=\"ds-toolbar-field\">Algorithm<select class=\"ds-toolbar-select\"><option>SHA-256</option><option>SHA-512</option></select></label><div class=\"ds-toolbar-field\"><span id=\"ds-format-label\">Output Format</span><div class=\"ds-toolbar-segmented\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-format-label\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-output-format\" checked /><span>Hexadecimal</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-output-format\" /><span>Base64</span></label></div></div><div class=\"ds-toolbar-actions\"><button class=\"ds-toolbar-primary\">Generate HMAC</button><button>Share</button><button>Send</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font:12px/1.65 var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;color:var(--wb-text-heading)}.ds-toolbar>.ds-toolbar-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex:0 1 auto;min-width:160px;font-weight:550}.ds-toolbar-select{font:inherit;font-weight:400;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:40px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--signal-control-border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--wb-card-bg);color:var(--wb-text-heading)}.ds-toolbar-select:hover{border-color:var(--signal-control-border)}.ds-toolbar-select:focus{border-color:var(--signal-secondary);box-shadow:none}.ds-toolbar-segmented{display:inline-flex;align-items:stretch;box-sizing:border-box;height:40px;padding:3px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--signal-inset)}.ds-toolbar-segmented label{position:relative;display:flex;cursor:pointer;font-weight:400}.ds-toolbar-segmented input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0}.ds-toolbar-segmented span{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:34px;line-height:22px;padding-inline:12px;border-radius:4px;color:var(--wb-text-body)}.ds-toolbar-segmented input:checked+span{background:var(--wb-card-bg);color:var(--wb-text-heading)}.ds-toolbar-segmented label:hover span{color:var(--wb-text-heading)}.ds-toolbar-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-toolbar-actions>button{font:550 12px/22px var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:40px;padding:8px 17px;border:1px solid var(--wb-card-border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--wb-card-bg);color:var(--wb-text-heading);cursor:pointer}.ds-toolbar-actions>.ds-toolbar-primary{background:var(--wb-accent);border-color:var(--wb-accent);color:var(--signal-action-ink)}.ds-toolbar-actions>button:hover{border-color:var(--signal-control-border)}.ds-toolbar-actions>button:not(.ds-toolbar-primary):hover{color:var(--wb-text-heading)}.ds-toolbar :is(select,button):focus-visible,.ds-toolbar-segmented input:focus-visible+span{outline:1px solid var(--wb-focus-ring);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-toolbar>.ds-toolbar-field{flex:1 1 160px}.ds-toolbar-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));flex-basis:100%}.ds-toolbar-actions>button{width:100%}.ds-toolbar-actions>button:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Footer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "One wrapping summary row holds copyright, What’s new, count, processing note and optional installation; colorful resource icons and links wrap on the following row. Snapshot shows the available-install state; release preference and runtime visibility remain component behavior.",
      "html": "<footer class=\"ds-footer\"><div class=\"ds-footer-summary\"><span>© 2026 My Dev Tools</span><a href=\"/release-notes\">What’s new</a><span>147 tools</span><span>Client-side by default · see each tool for details</span><button>Install app</button></div><nav aria-label=\"Resources\"><a class=\"ds-footer-releases\" href=\"/release-notes\"><svg viewBox=\"64 64 896 896\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M880 310H732.4c13.6-21.4 21.6-46.8 21.6-74 0-76.1-61.9-138-138-138-41.4 0-78.7 18.4-104 47.4-25.3-29-62.6-47.4-104-47.4-76.1 0-138 61.9-138 138 0 27.2 7.9 52.6 21.6 74H144c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32v200c0 4.4 3.6 8 8 8h40v344c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h640c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V550h40c4.4 0 8-3.6 8-8V342c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zm-334-74c0-38.6 31.4-70 70-70s70 31.4 70 70-31.4 70-70 70h-70v-70zm-138-70c38.6 0 70 31.4 70 70v70h-70c-38.6 0-70-31.4-70-70s31.4-70 70-70zM180 482V378h298v104H180zm48 68h250v308H228V550zm568 308H546V550h250v308zm48-376H546V378h298v104z\"/></svg>Release notes · 2.1.0</a><a class=\"ds-footer-author\" href=\"https://rameshsnotebook.com/\"><svg viewBox=\"64 64 896 896\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M858.5 763.6a374 374 0 00-80.6-119.5 375.63 375.63 0 00-119.5-80.6c-.4-.2-.8-.3-1.2-.5C719.5 518 760 444.7 760 362c0-137-111-248-248-248S264 225 264 362c0 82.7 40.5 156 102.8 201.1-.4.2-.8.3-1.2.5-44.8 18.9-85 46-119.5 80.6a375.63 375.63 0 00-80.6 119.5A371.7 371.7 0 00136 901.8a8 8 0 008 8.2h60c4.4 0 7.9-3.5 8-7.8 2-77.2 33-149.5 87.8-204.3 56.7-56.7 132-87.9 212.2-87.9s155.5 31.2 212.2 87.9C779 752.7 810 825 812 902.2c.1 4.4 3.6 7.8 8 7.8h60a8 8 0 008-8.2c-1-47.8-10.9-94.3-29.5-138.2zM512 534c-45.9 0-89.1-17.9-121.6-50.4S340 407.9 340 362c0-45.9 17.9-89.1 50.4-121.6S466.1 190 512 190s89.1 17.9 121.6 50.4S684 316.1 684 362c0 45.9-17.9 89.1-50.4 121.6S557.9 534 512 534z\"/></svg>Ramesh Maharaddi</a><a class=\"ds-footer-social ds-footer-github\" href=\"https://github.com/rameshbgm/mydevtools\" aria-label=\"GitHub profile\"><svg viewBox=\"64 64 896 896\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M511.6 76.3C264.3 76.2 64 276.4 64 523.5 64 718.9 189.3 885 363.8 946c23.5 5.9 19.9-10.8 19.9-22.2v-77.5c-135.7 15.9-141.2-73.9-150.3-88.9C215 726 171.5 718 184.5 703c30.9-15.9 62.4 4 98.9 57.9 26.4 39.1 77.9 32.5 104 26 5.7-23.5 17.9-44.5 34.7-60.8-140.6-25.2-199.2-111-199.2-213 0-49.5 16.3-95 48.3-131.7-20.4-60.5 1.9-112.3 4.9-120 58.1-5.2 118.5 41.6 123.2 45.3 33-8.9 70.7-13.6 112.9-13.6 42.4 0 80.2 4.9 113.5 13.9 11.3-8.6 67.3-48.8 121.3-43.9 2.9 7.7 24.7 58.3 5.5 118 32.4 36.8 48.9 82.7 48.9 132.3 0 102.2-59 188.1-200 212.9a127.5 127.5 0 0138.1 91v112.5c.8 9 0 17.9 15 17.9 177.1-59.7 304.6-227 304.6-424.1 0-247.2-200.4-447.3-447.5-447.3z\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-footer-social ds-footer-linkedin\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rameshbgm/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn profile\"><svg viewBox=\"64 64 896 896\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M847.7 112H176.3c-35.5 0-64.3 28.8-64.3 64.3v671.4c0 35.5 28.8 64.3 64.3 64.3h671.4c35.5 0 64.3-28.8 64.3-64.3V176.3c0-35.5-28.8-64.3-64.3-64.3zm0 736c-447.8-.1-671.7-.2-671.7-.3.1-447.8.2-671.7.3-671.7 447.8.1 671.7.2 671.7.3-.1 447.8-.2 671.7-.3 671.7zM230.6 411.9h118.7v381.8H230.6zm59.4-52.2c37.9 0 68.8-30.8 68.8-68.8a68.8 68.8 0 10-137.6 0c-.1 38 30.7 68.8 68.8 68.8zm252.3 245.1c0-49.8 9.5-98 71.2-98 60.8 0 61.7 56.9 61.7 101.2v185.7h118.6V584.3c0-102.8-22.2-181.9-142.3-181.9-57.7 0-96.4 31.7-112.3 61.7h-1.6v-52.2H423.7v381.8h118.6V604.8z\"/></svg></a></nav></footer>",
      "css": ".ds-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 24px;font:12px/1.65 var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;color:var(--wb-text-body)}.ds-footer-summary,.ds-footer nav{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 16px}.ds-footer a{color:var(--wb-text-body);text-decoration:none}.ds-footer a:hover{color:var(--wb-accent);text-decoration:underline}.ds-footer nav{margin-inline-start:auto;justify-content:flex-end}.ds-footer nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:32px;font-weight:500}.ds-footer svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-footer button{height:32px;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid var(--wb-card-border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--wb-card-bg);color:var(--wb-text-heading);font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-footer button:hover{border-color:var(--signal-control-border)}.ds-footer button:active{border-color:var(--signal-secondary)}.ds-footer :is(a,button):focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--wb-focus-ring);outline-offset:3px}.ds-footer .ds-footer-releases{color:var(--signal-code-number)}.ds-footer .ds-footer-author{color:var(--signal-code-string)}.ds-footer .ds-footer-social{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--signal-surface)}.ds-footer-social svg{width:19px;height:19px}.ds-footer .ds-footer-github{color:#7352c7}.ds-footer .ds-footer-linkedin{color:#0a66c2}:host-context(.dark) .ds-footer .ds-footer-github{color:#c5a3ff}:host-context(.dark) .ds-footer .ds-footer-linkedin{color:#80bbff}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-footer nav{margin-inline-start:0;justify-content:flex-start}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Signal",
    "overview": "Signal is the user-approved visual direction for the entire application: home, catalog, tool pages, workspaces, supporting pages and shared overlays. It replaces the former introduction-only identity. Pale slate and navy surfaces, blue actions, compact typography and ruled layouts keep real developer work prominent.\n\nThe reference preview remains a historical decision artifact. Production groups a centered Developer tools / Open by design headline, privacy explanation covering sensitive-data risks, local processing, disclosed network connections and inspectable MIT-licensed code, paired explore/source actions, a ruled trust strip, randomized tool carousel and workspace links in one hero frame above the integrated catalog. These design documents record the implemented redesign; they do not announce publication of a 2.1 release.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A coherent paired light/dark semantic palette across custom CSS and Ant Design.",
      "Compact 12px UI copy, aligned controls and larger purposeful headings.",
      "Full-width home with integrated category navigation; working controls lead tool pages.",
      "Real registry-driven discovery, canonical tool links and explicit data boundaries.",
      "Keyboard operation, reduced-motion behavior and eight-language/RTL support are preserved."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Paired Surface Rule",
        "body": "Change the complete semantic set together; preserve text, action-foreground, control-border and status relationships in both themes.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Neutral Focus Rule",
        "body": "Show keyboard focus with one thin neutral outline; do not add cobalt halos or a second frame to editable controls.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Data Face Rule",
        "body": "Use mono for actual technical data; keep labels and explanatory UI in Geist and the landing display in Sora.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Working Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep normal tools and catalog surfaces flat; reserve elevation for layers above the current working context.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use Signal across all application pages while retaining the marketing/workspace source split.",
      "Do use semantic foreground/background pairs and stronger control borders in both themes.",
      "Do keep body, form and navigation text at the shared 12px scale; preserve heading and numerical hierarchy.",
      "Do align normal form controls at 40px, allow long labels to wrap, and collapse grids before fields overlap.",
      "Do use one neutral 1px keyboard outline and neutral editable selection states while retaining cobalt brand actions and navigation.",
      "Do keep the 18px gutter in mixed-content cards; remove it only for a sole direct editor child.",
      "Do keep footer summary items in one wrapping row and colorful resource links on the following row.",
      "Do keep tool controls above guidance and reference material, with compact network disclosures still available.",
      "Do derive discovery from the real registry and navigate with toolPath or toolPathFromId.",
      "Do preserve existing tools, saved data, bookmark menus, projects and all eight locale choices with RTL support.",
      "Do retain clear pause, focus and reduced-motion behavior for automatic discovery."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't restore duplicate outer home sidebars, an unbounded sticky category list or the removed fixed API call-to-action.",
      "Don't introduce gradients, glass, decorative shadows or fabricated live tool output into Signal discovery.",
      "Don't make network requests or access saved payloads merely to animate a carousel illustration.",
      "Don't mistake the historical three-demo preview for the production tool catalog or its persistence behavior.",
      "Don't describe this implementation or review as a published 2.1 release or comprehensive functional certification of every tool."
    ]
  }
}
